{"title":{"en":"Weeping Willow","de":"Trauerweide"},"summary":{"en":"A mature weeping willow (Salix alba 'Tristis') of about 12 m: a short, massive, buttressed trunk that divides at 3.5 m into arching limbs, from which eight long curtains of pendulous whips and leaves cascade almost to the ground and form a wide, bell-shaped crown.","de":"Eine ausgewachsene Trauerweide (Salix alba 'Tristis') von etwa 12 m: kurzer, mächtiger, wulstiger Stamm, der sich in 3,5 m Höhe in Bogenäste teilt, von denen acht lange Vorhänge aus hängenden Ruten und Blättern bis fast zum Boden fallen und eine weite, glockenförmige Krone bilden."},"tags":["tree","deciduous","broadleaf","pendulous","wind","transpiration"],"provenance":{"author":"Semio staffage vegetation content worker","method":"handcrafted","created":"2026-10-29","references":[{"id":"wood-handbook-2021","citation":"Forest Products Laboratory (2021). Wood Handbook: Wood as an Engineering Material. General Technical Report FPL-GTR-282, USDA Forest Service. Chapter 5 (green density, modulus of elasticity and rupture; closest listed species used as proxy)."},{"id":"en-1991-1-4","citation":"EN 1991-1-4:2005 Eurocode 1, Actions on structures, Part 1-4: Wind actions. Air density 1.25 kg/m3, F = 0.5 rho cd A v^2, peak velocity pressure (1 + 7 Iv) q_m."},{"id":"vogel-1989","citation":"Vogel, S. (1989). Drag and reconfiguration of broad leaves in high winds. Journal of Experimental Botany 40(8), 941-948."},{"id":"koerner-1979","citation":"Koerner, C., Scheel, J. A. and Bauer, H. (1979). Maximum leaf diffusive conductance in vascular plants. Photosynthetica 13(1), 45-82."},{"id":"jones-2014","citation":"Jones, H. G. (2014). Plants and Microclimate, 3rd ed., Cambridge University Press. Leaf energy balance, leaf area index, boundary-layer conductance."},{"id":"monteith-unsworth-2013","citation":"Monteith, J. L. and Unsworth, M. H. (2013). Principles of Environmental Physics, 4th ed., Academic Press. Penman-Monteith leaf transpiration."}],"notes":{"en":"Each curtain is its own pendulum bone hanging from the arching limbs; in wind the curtains swing to the lee by gravity-drag equilibrium (about 9 degrees at 8 m/s, 30 degrees at 22 m/s) while the stiff limbs hardly move. Winter-bare geometry is not offered because shapes cannot be toggled by a pose; the third pose is a gale.","de":"Jeder Vorhang ist ein eigener Pendelknochen an den Bogenästen; im Wind schwingen die Vorhänge im Gleichgewicht von Schwerkraft und Widerstand nach Lee (etwa 9 Grad bei 8 m/s, 30 Grad bei 22 m/s), während sich die steifen Äste kaum bewegen. Eine winterkahle Geometrie wird nicht angeboten, da Formen durch eine Pose nicht ausgeblendet werden können; die dritte Pose ist ein Sturm."}},"dimensions":{"heightM":11.6,"widthM":15,"depthM":14,"massKg":2950},"materials":[{"id":"willow-bark","title":{"en":"Deeply furrowed willow bark","de":"Tief gefurchte Weidenrinde"},"emissivity":0.95,"solarAbsorptivity":0.75,"densityKgM3":450,"conductivityWmK":0.11,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"willow-leaf","title":{"en":"Narrow willow leaves on whips","de":"Schmale Weidenblätter an Ruten"},"emissivity":0.97,"solarAbsorptivity":0.45,"source":"literature","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"willow-wood","title":{"en":"Green willow wood","de":"Frisches Weidenholz"},"emissivity":0.9,"solarAbsorptivity":0.65,"densityKgM3":800,"conductivityWmK":0.14,"elasticModulusPa":5000000000.0,"strengthPa":33000000.0,"source":"literature","reference":"wood-handbook-2021"}],"poses":[{"id":"calm","title":{"en":"Calm summer day","de":"Windstiller Sommertag"},"description":{"en":"Light air of 1.5 m/s: the curtains hang plumb from the arching limbs, drag per curtain is 2 to 3 N.","de":"Leiser Zug von 1,5 m/s: Die Vorhänge hängen lotrecht an den Bogenästen, der Widerstand je Vorhang beträgt 2 bis 3 N."},"bones":{"curt-w4":{"angleDeg":0.5},"curt-e4":{"angleDeg":0.5}},"ground":"authored","contacts":[],"thermal":{"operating":{},"emitters":{"transpirati